{
 "turns_text": [
  "[SEG0001] person_1 (CLINICAL_STAFF): Howzit. You're a few minutes late, doctor's ready though.",
  "[SEG0002] person_2 (PATIENT): Ag sorry hey. The robot by the mall was dead and a bakkie blocked the lane. Sat there for ages.",
  "[SEG0003] person_3 (DOCTOR): Come in. Sit. What is it?",
  "[SEG0004] person_2 (PATIENT): Err, my sister's on biotin tablets for her hair, big ones, she made me promise to mention it. Not my problem though.",
  "[SEG0005] person_3 (DOCTOR): Not yours. Why are you here?",
  "[SEG0006] person_2 (PATIENT): Ja. Outside of my right elbow. It's been killing me.",
  "[SEG0007] person_3 (DOCTOR): How long, and what sets it off?",
  "[SEG0008] person_2 (PATIENT): Six weeks. It's worse lifting a cup, even a coffee, and gripping the brush. Also if I lie on that side. Started after I painted eaves overhead in Durbanville.",
  "[SEG0009] person_2 (PATIENT): I'm a painter, hey. The client changed the colour three times, grey then green, I nearly lost it with the...",
  "[SEG0010] person_3 (DOCTOR): Right. Any swelling?",
  "[SEG0011] person_2 (PATIENT): No swelling.",
  "[SEG0012] person_3 (DOCTOR): Red or hot?",
  "[SEG0013] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Not red, not hot.",
  "[SEG0014] person_3 (DOCTOR): Tingling in the fingers?",
  "[SEG0015] person_2 (PATIENT): Umm Saturday's braai, I couldn't work the tongs and my wife started saying maybe it's a nerve and...",
  "[SEG0016] person_3 (DOCTOR): Tingling, yes or no?",
  "[SEG0017] person_2 (PATIENT): No. No tingling. Fingers are fine.",
  "[SEG0018] person_3 (DOCTOR): Does it go into the shoulder?",
  "[SEG0019] person_2 (PATIENT): Shoulder, ag, my bakkie's clutch is stiffer than...",
  "[SEG0020] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Stays on the outer elbow. Doesn't go up to the shoulder.",
  "[SEG0021] person_3 (DOCTOR): Let me feel it. Tender on the outer bony point, pain when you extend the wrist against me. No swelling I can see.",
  "[SEG0022] person_3 (DOCTOR): Tablets?",
  "[SEG0023] person_2 (PATIENT): My brother's on metformin, he's diabetic, always telling me to check my sugar. I don't take his pills.",
  "[SEG0024] person_2 (PATIENT): I take ibuprofin. 400 mg twice a day with food, for two weeks. Helps a bit.",
  "[SEG0025] person_3 (DOCTOR): Anything else you take?",
  "[SEG0026] person_2 (PATIENT): No. Just the ibuprofin.",
  "[SEG0027] person_3 (DOCTOR): Allergies to medicine?",
  "[SEG0028] person_2 (PATIENT): No. No allergies.",
  "[SEG0029] person_3 (DOCTOR): This looks like tennis elbow from the painting. No injection yet.",
  "[SEG0030] person_3 (DOCTOR): Get a forearm brace and book physio. Keep the ibuprofen, ice it after work.",
  "[SEG0031] person_2 (PATIENT): Sharp, will the brace be one of those straps? My mate had one and he said it was lekker for...",
  "[SEG0032] person_3 (DOCTOR): Yes, a strap below the elbow. Come back in four weeks."
 ],
